        <mxCell id="afk6OYJIJqATBkYILG2x-24" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=12;spacingLeft=12;fontSize=16;fontColor=#000000;" value="&lt;b&gt;Knows&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;•&amp;nbsp;&lt;li&gt;Current account, reservation conversation, messages, and draft.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Loading, sending, failure, and read state.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Does&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li&gt;Display the reservation conversation.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Validate participants and permitted senders.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Send nonblank messages and request alerts.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Preserve drafts after failed sends.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Acknowledge received messages after display.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Provide read-only message logs to Administration.&lt;/li&gt;" vertex="1">
