        <mxCell id="afk6OYJIJqATBkYILG2x-29" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=12;spacingLeft=12;fontSize=16;fontColor=#000000;" value="&lt;b&gt;Knows&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;•&lt;li&gt;Stored accounts, campsites, lotteries, reservations, messages, reviews, and notifications.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Image attachments and pending cleanup jobs.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Does&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li&gt;Store, retrieve, and observe application records.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Enforce authorized reads and writes.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Save related changes together to prevent inconsistent records.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Upload and remove image files.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Resume interrupted delivery and cleanup while preserving history.&lt;/li&gt;" vertex="1">
